23982:
Eu gains stability from a half-filled shell so [\text{Xe}] 4f^{7} 6s^{2}
Gd keeps 4f^{7} and places one electron in 5d so [\text{Xe}] 4f^{7} 5d^{1} 6s^{2}
Tb returns to no 5d electron with [\text{Xe}] 4f^{9} 6s^{2}
This is the option with [\text{Xe}] 4f^{7} 6s^{2}, [\text{Xe}] 4f^{7} 5d^{1} 6s^{2} and [\text{Xe}] 4f^{9} 6s^{2}
