24003:
For cubic cell \rho = \frac{ZM}{a^{3}N_{A}} with bcc Z = 2
Rearranged form is a^{3} = \frac{ZM}{\rho N_{A}}
Putting M near 6.94 and density near 530 in SI gives a^{3} near 43.5 \times 10^{-30} m^{3}
Cube root is near 3.52 \times 10^{-10} m as 352 pm which is option A
